<section class="faq-section" style="padding: 50px 0; background: #0b132b; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 15px;">
    <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: center;">
      Frequently Asked Questions &bull; Booking a Joint Shifting Package: Packers and Movers Plus Car Transport Service
    </h2>
    
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What documents are required to book a joint shifting package that includes car transport from Delhi to Mumbai?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">You will need a valid government‑issued ID, GSTIN certificate, original vehicle registration certificate, insurance policy copy, and a signed e‑Way bill. Shree Ashirwad also asks for a signed service agreement that outlines the zero‑scratch guarantee and the detailed cost breakdown. Providing these upfront speeds up the booking and ensures compliance with IBA mover code.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does the hydraulic ramp trailer prevent scratches or dents on my car during the Delhi‑Mumbai transit?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The trailer uses a motor‑driven hydraulic ramp that lowers the vehicle gently onto a non‑slip rubberized deck. Once positioned, multi‑point wheel chocks and high‑tensile ratchet lashings secure the car. Combined with 7‑layer shock‑absorbent packaging and real‑time GPS monitoring, the system guarantees a scratch‑free journey, backed by IRDAI‑approved insurance.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I track my household goods and car simultaneously while they travel on NH 19?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. Shree Ashirwad equips every container truck and car carrier with satellite GPS that streams live location to a secure client portal. You receive separate tracking IDs for your household shipment and vehicle, allowing you to monitor both movements in real time and receive instant alerts for any route deviation.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Is the joint shifting package cost‑effective compared to hiring separate movers and a car carrier?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Booking a joint package consolidates logistics, reduces duplicate handling fees, and leverages a single GST‑compliant invoice. The combined mileage, fuel surcharge, and insurance are calculated once, often saving 12‑18 % versus two independent contracts. Transparent cost matrices on the quote page make the savings easy to verify.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What insurance coverage is included for my car during the Delhi‑to‑Mumbai shift?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Every vehicle transported under the joint package is covered by a 100 % declared‑value, IRDAI‑approved marine transit insurance. This protects against loss, theft, and accidental damage. The policy also includes a zero‑deductible clause for any scratch‑free claim, ensuring you receive full reimbursement without out‑of‑pocket expenses.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How long will the combined household and car relocation take from Delhi to Mumbai?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The typical transit time on the NH 19 corridor is 3‑4 days, depending on traffic and weather conditions. Shree Ashirwad schedules a synchronized loading window so that your household items and vehicle depart together, minimizing idle time and ensuring both reach Mumbai within the promised window.</p>
      </div>
  </div>
